    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107468" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερεξαίρω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>raise exceedingly</i>: 
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				4.31
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>exalt</i> or <i>praise exceedingly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1265.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> intr.,
				<i>excel, be privileged,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ουσαν τῇ ζωῇ τῇ ἀκραιφνεστάτῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Sent.</u>
					40
				</span></i>
			 (but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπερζέουσαν ζωῇ</span> in
				<i><span class="en">
				Plot.
				6.5.12
			</span></i>).</div>
